{
    "title": "SRGT\uff0dRacing & Car Driving Game",
    "description": "Become the city's best racer, drift your way to victory, and upgrade your car in <b>Street Racing Grand Tour</b> - car driving games. Compete in fast and furious drag races, extreme car driving, illegal racing, drift challenges and time attacks - leave everybody else behind in drag racing games!\r\n \r\nStyle your own car as you see fit. Choose from a wide variety of lightning-fast concept cars and tune-worthy popular brands. Use the tight controls to leave any competition in the dust! Explore the streets of a massive city full of skyscrapers, industrial buildings or shopping centers. More victories in drag racing games will open up the way to new cards, new parts, new upgrades, new ways of extreme car driving and illegal racing.\r\n \r\nUPGRADE EVERY PART OF YOUR CAR!\r\nFill your garage with sweet rides, then take them to the mechanic for a full overhaul. Explore tuning advantages and find the best combination to snatch those golden milliseconds to win that top-speed drag racing simulator.\r\n \r\nPUT THE PEDAL TO THE METAL\r\nThe streets of the entire city are your battleground, with dozens of diverse racetracks for both discerning and amateur racers alike. Get those nitro juices burning and win the race before your opponents hear you rolling!\r\n \r\nRACE TO THE WIN!\r\nEvery race is a real challenge. You're on the first step in the long career of a lucky street racer, but the top is only for the best and the most persistent. Get the best rides in town and make the rest RESPECT you!\r\n\r\n_____________________________________\r\nIf you like Street Racing Grand Tour - car driving games\r\n\r\nFOLLOW US: @Herocraft \r\nWATCH US: youtube.com/herocraft \r\nLIKE US: facebook.com/herocraft.games",
    "descriptionHTML": "Become the city&#39;s best racer, drift your way to victory, and upgrade your car in <b>Street Racing Grand Tour</b> - car driving games. Compete in fast and furious drag races, extreme car driving, illegal racing, drift challenges and time attacks - leave everybody else behind in drag racing games!<br> <br>Style your own car as you see fit. Choose from a wide variety of lightning-fast concept cars and tune-worthy popular brands. Use the tight controls to leave any competition in the dust! Explore the streets of a massive city full of skyscrapers, industrial buildings or shopping centers. More victories in drag racing games will open up the way to new cards, new parts, new upgrades, new ways of extreme car driving and illegal racing.<br> <br>UPGRADE EVERY PART OF YOUR CAR!<br>Fill your garage with sweet rides, then take them to the mechanic for a full overhaul. Explore tuning advantages and find the best combination to snatch those golden milliseconds to win that top-speed drag racing simulator.<br> <br>PUT THE PEDAL TO THE METAL<br>The streets of the entire city are your battleground, with dozens of diverse racetracks for both discerning and amateur racers alike. Get those nitro juices burning and win the race before your opponents hear you rolling!<br> <br>RACE TO THE WIN!<br>Every race is a real challenge. You&#39;re on the first step in the long career of a lucky street racer, but the top is only for the best and the most persistent. Get the best rides in town and make the rest RESPECT you!<br><br>_____________________________________<br>If you like Street Racing Grand Tour - car driving games<br><br>FOLLOW US: @Herocraft <br>WATCH US: youtube.com/herocraft <br>LIKE US: facebook.com/herocraft.games",
